							<a href="https://www.facebook.com/movaciifsul" target="_blank" class="icon" style="margin-left: 1em;"><img src="alpha/images/facebook.png" alt="Facebook MOVACI" style="width:35px;height:35px;" /></a>
							<a href="https://github.com/GeovaneGriesang/PDIAP" target="_blank" class="icon" style="margin-left: 0.75em;"><img src="alpha/images/github.png" alt="GitHub MOVACI" style="width:35px;height:35px;" /></a>
							<a href="https://www.instagram.com/movaci.ifsul/" target="_blank" class="icon" style="margin-left: 0.75em;"><img src="alpha/images/instagram.svg" alt="Instagram MOVACI" style="width:35px;height:35px;" /></a>
